eading', 'Welcome to Prisma AIRS Desktop', 1, True, True), ('AXStaticText', 'Welcome to Prisma AIRS Desktop', 'Welcome to Prisma AIRS Desktop', True, False), ('AXStaticText', 'This app is built entirely on Palo Alto Networks’ own public APIs: the same programmatic interfaces any application builder can use. Everything you will see here, from reading a tenant’s security posture to scanning a prompt, is an API call you could make yourself. It exists to show how much those interfaces make possible.', 'This app is built entirely on Palo Alto Networks’ own public APIs: the same programmatic interfaces any application builder can use. Everything you will see here, from reading a tenant’s security posture to scanning a prompt, is an API call you could make yourself. It exists to show how much those interfaces make possible.', True, False), ('AXStaticText', 'We will walk you through it: connect a tenant with the credentials an integration would use, pick the products you manage, check the connection, and optionally load starter test cases. It takes about five minutes, and you can change everything later.', 'We will walk you through it: connect a tenant with the credentials an integration would use, pick the products you manage, check the connection, and optionally load starter test cases. It takes about five minutes, and you can change everything later.', True, False), ('AXStaticText', 'Built on the public APIs', 'Built on the public APIs', True, False), ('AXStaticText', 'Nothing here uses a private interface. What the app reads and changes, your own code can read and change.', 'Nothing here uses a private interface. What the app reads and changes, your own code can read and change.', True, False), ('AXStaticText', 'See the calls as you go', 'See the calls as you go', True, False), ('AXStaticText', 'With “Show the calls” on, each request the app sends is shown as it happens, with its response.', 'With “Show the calls” on, each request the app sends is shown as it happens, w